  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-EUC-NPC02-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Really, it's on them. They drain all their resources and whine they have nothing more to sell. That's what set the Riders off.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_LeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Morp_WL-EUC_016.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560328,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-EUC-NPC02-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I hear it in their heads - Thought-Leader that I am - rage. Rage and also toads. Dreams are weird like that. Sometimes there's toads.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_LeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Morp_WL-EUC_017.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560328,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-EUC-NPC02-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "And then Emus leapt out of the Pink Lake, followed shortly after by Drop Bears. Nightmares, they are, made real.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Koala_LeaderF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Morp_WL-EUC_018.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560328,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-EUC-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Hmm. But whose nightmares? And why? Something triggered these events, something specific. Wizard, catch a Drop Bear and bring it to Camp for study.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-EUC_019.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560323,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-EUC-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Apologies if Morp seems suspicious, Wizard. The Drovers are constantly struggling to protect the Dreaming from their Townie peers.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-EUC_022.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560323,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-EUC-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "They live in fear that somehow if the wrong minds enter the Dreaming, the entity that creates it will be corrupted.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-EUC_023.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560323,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-EUC-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Suffice to say, I once exemplified that fear. My Walkabout inspired me to create a garden paradise in the desert, a haven for any frog.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-EUC_024.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560323,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-EUC-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It quickly became any frog who could afford it. And that range got narrower and narrower until- well, corruption, as Morp says.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-EUC_025.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560323,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-EUC-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The Resort is just down this way. Let's go see for ourselves what has become of it.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-EUC_026.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560323,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "WL-EUC-NPC01-A_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "What... what is happening here?",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Frog_Joan_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/Joan_Locke_WL-EUC_027.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1560323,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
